{"id":"498998","name":"苹果胡萝卜雪耳汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/498998/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苹果","amount":"2个"},{"name":"雪耳","amount":"1朵"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"猪骨","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"北杏","amount":"5克"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"2粒"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苹果去皮去核切小块","img":"images/498998/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"雪耳泡发，去蒂撕小块。","img":"images/498998/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮切块。","img":"images/498998/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"北杏洗净。","img":"images/498998/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"猪骨飞水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/498998/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把所有材料放入电压力锅，按煲汤键开煮","img":"images/498998/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮好后撇去肥油即可。","img":"images/498998/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"清润清甜。","img":"images/498998/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}